      "parameters": {
        "width": 640,
        "height": 220,
        "content": "## Sahyadri: admin email desk\nThe housing portal POSTs here (env ADMIN_EMAIL_WEBHOOK_URL) for every new complaint, message to check, registration and emergency when no committee member has the dashboard open (emergencies always).\nThe portal builds the email: details plus signed buttons (assign vendor, start, close, reply, approve AI suggestion, approve/reject resident, resolve emergency). Buttons open a confirm page on the portal, which runs the same action as the dashboard.\nSent from and to the connected Gmail account. Keep the webhook path secret."
